{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43000","headline":"冬晚对雪忆胡处士 · 王邵","name":"冬晚对雪忆胡处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒更传唱晚，清镜览衰颜。\n隔牖风惊竹，开帘雪满山。\n洒空深巷静，积素广庭闲。\n借问袁安舍，翛然尚闭关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王邵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}